        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(auth): decouple plugin synthetic-auth from profile fallback for gateway attempts (#110103)",
        "body": "Closes #110103\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where anthropic-vertex users whose only credential is Google ADC (Application Default Credentials) hit \"No API key found\" on gateway-routed model calls, even though the same synthetic ADC auth resolves under `--local` and the plugin itself confirms it works.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nA gateway direct-attempt sets `allowAuthProfileFallback: false` so an unrelated stored-profile store cannot replace or pre-reject the immutable env/config source. `resolveApiKeyForProvider` was gating the provider plugin synthetic-auth hook on that same flag (`allowPluginSyntheticAuth: params.allowAuthProfileFallback !== false`), so turning off profile fallback also silenced the plugin hook and the gateway path failed for ADC-only providers.\n\nThis adds a distinct `allowPluginSyntheticAuth` flag on `resolveApiKeyForProvider` and `getApiKeyForModel`. It defaults to the previous coupled value so existing callers are unchanged, and the two gateway direct-attempt seams (`runtime-plan/resolve-auth` and the embedded-agent-runner `auth-controller`) pass it `true`. Stored-profile discovery stays gated by `allowAuthProfileFallback`, so the prepared-attempt isolation invariant is preserved: enabling plugin synthetic-auth does not re-open the profile store.\n\n## User Impact\n\nanthropic-vertex and other GCP-ADC-only providers now authenticate over the gateway route the same way they already do under `--local`. No behavior change for any provider that resolves through a stored profile or an env/config key.\n\n## Evidence\n\nTwo regression tests added in `src/agents/model-auth.test.ts`:\n- a gateway-isolated attempt (`allowAuthProfileFallback: false`) now resolves plugin synthetic auth\n- stored-profile isolation still holds: a stored api-key profile stays unresolved when profile fallback is off, even with `allowPluginSyntheticAuth: true`\n\nLocal run of the full model-auth suite (vitest 4.1.10, Node 24 on Windows):\n\n```\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  162 passed (162)\n```\n\n## AI disclosure\n\nThis change was written with Claude (Opus 4.8). I reviewed the diff, ran the tests locally, and take responsibility for the contents.\n",
